没有过的，而且她什么都不会做，根本不像是我们这样的人！”“你确定他是女孩子？”楚炑摆出一副持保留态度的样子，比起朴实的部族中人，他的脑子会多想很多东西，也不容易相信人。的确，部族里是需要这样一个心思比较多的首领，否则被人吃掉还不知道呢！幡戈听到楚炑这样问，嘿嘿的笑了：“我也是今天才确定，她个子太小，毛发那么短，胸部还很小!所以来了好几天，嗯，这么些天，我今天才敢确定！”幡戈在地上拣了五个石头，代表五天，可是他们还不会数数，只能这样表达。“是女孩子还不错，就算不会做什么也没关系，以后可以为男人们生孩子！”部族里的女人很少，二十多个人中，只有7个是女人。楚炑到现在还不相信莫忆儿是神灵的人，只确定她不会对部落带来灾难就行。“阿兄，你带来那个女人是谁？”幡戈问的是刚刚在楚炑身边黑黑的那个女人，他没见过，不是部族中的人。“她是海姆部落老首领的女儿！”楚炑回答的时候，眼中是满满的无奈。“哦？可她为什么来我们部族？”“她看中了我，想要拥有我的小孩，然后再回海姆部落。”听了楚炑的话，幡戈是满满的愤怒：“太过分了，看中了阿兄就投到我们坎内部族好了，还想把阿兄的孩子带走，简直是做梦！”楚炑没有再说什么，但那眼中的态度和幡戈完全一样，是不允许那个女人把他的孩子带回海姆部落的。此刻的莫忆儿已经被桑贞带到一个储物洞，洞里面满满的全是兽皮。由于各种不同种类的毛皮都堆放到一起，形成了很复杂的味道，很是不好闻。但莫忆儿还是很兴奋的，皮草诶，全部都是真的，不是人造的，这要是拿去二十一世纪，要值多少钱？她是算不出来！“莫忆儿，你可以随便选你喜欢的毛皮！”桑贞笑着对莫忆儿说，她自从知道了莫忆儿是从天上落下来的，就对莫忆儿一直很尊重，除了看住莫忆儿以外，对她是完全的好。“谢谢你！”莫忆儿道了谢，在众多毛皮中挑选着。这些毛皮只是经过了简单的处理，所以皮子部分有些干硬，触上去并不舒服。现在天气还很热，莫忆儿选了两块比较薄的小羊皮，看那大小，应该还是羊羔的时候就被宰杀了。桑贞对莫忆儿选得毛皮有些吃惊，不过却没有说什么，之后和莫忆儿回到了山洞，拿出骨针和兽筋要帮助莫忆儿缝兽皮裙。骨针对于原始人来说已经是很精致的日用品，可和现代的铁针、钢针比起来简直笨拙的多，莫忆儿也拿了一支来，她打算为自己缝制个小背心，让她像这群原始人一样露出两只小蜜桃，那是绝对不可以的。缝制简单的背心对莫忆儿来说是小菜一碟，谁让她是从小在孤儿院长大的呢？姐姐莫金然是个男孩子性格，所以她这妹妹有时候还要照顾姐姐，为她缝缝扣子，改改衣服什么的。孤儿院里很穷，他们小时候都是穿好心人捐赠的衣服，大小几乎没有合适的，孤儿院的工作人员又很少，所以常常要自己改衣服。用一块木炭在白色的小羊皮上画出两片背心的图案，然后拿起桑贞的石刀使劲儿的割着。这可是个费劲儿的活，石刀太钝，想要按着弧度隔断羊皮的技术程度太高，为了不糟蹋羊皮，莫忆儿只能一丁点一丁点的来。“你这是做什么？”楚炑已经回来了，看着莫忆儿正和石刀、羊皮做斗争，忍不住开口问。不过，那已经洗的干干净净，俊美得不像话的五官上仍是面无表情，若非要说有的话，也是那么一点点的倨傲，让人看起来很不舒服。莫忆儿白了楚炑一眼，并没有回答。桑贞却笑着插嘴：“首领，莫忆儿说要做一件背心，穿在胸部的！”边说，还边指了指自己颤动的胸部，大大的，就像两只甜瓜一样大！楚炑没有不能看人家胸部的自觉，点了点头，目光又落在莫忆儿只遮了几片树叶的胸部，问道：“你活了多少个春天了？怎么胸部这么小，真让我怀疑你到底是不是女孩子！”莫忆儿觉得，自己这辈子最讨厌的人肯定是面前这位首领了，太过分了！“我胸部小怎么了？我胸小，我骄傲，我为国家省布料——嗯，兽皮！”楚炑唇角微勾，似乎是在笑：“省？我们部族的女人都不会把胸部遮住，你是在浪费，不过，国家是什么？”莫忆儿心里不爽，却也不敢太和这位首领太做对，且不说这是人家的地盘，就算是这位楚炑首领的高大，自己要是惹怒了他还不被一拳打死？不过，莫忆儿还不忘了神神叨叨一下：“国家是神灵住的地方！”楚炑闻言眉头皱了起来，拿过莫忆儿手里的石刀：“是按着这条东西割下去吗？”“是的，按着这条线割下去！”真是笨家伙，线条都不知道怎么叫。看在他帮助自己割兽皮的份儿上，就告诉他本姑娘多大了吧：“我二十岁了，你呢？”“二十岁？”楚炑听不太明白。“就是你们说的过了二十个春天！”“二十个是多少！”楚炑继续问，莫忆儿才想起来，这群原始人不会数数。于是，从洞外面找了二十个石头给他看。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 7: Ban Ge, a primitive man who can’t count, calls Sang Zhen, the woman who had watched Mo Yi’er before. Let Sang Zhen take Mo Yi'er to pick out animal skins, while she stayed by Chu Yi's side. Chu Yi had a simple exchange with each clan member and asked everyone to perform their duties and stop surrounding him. Chu Yi himself took the banner and walked away to the waterfall to wash away the dust. While washing, he asked: \"Are you sure that child fell from the sky?\" Child? If Mo Yi'er hears this and has to go crazy, screw you kid, she's already 20 years old! \"Yes, brother, Xiao Lala saw Mo Yi'er falling from the sky, right in the jungle over there!\" When the two of them were alone, Bange called Chu Yi brother, and they were half-children. Chu Yi glanced at the jungle pointed by Ban Ge, where there were lush trees and many prey. He knew and believed that his people would not lie, but he still had a wait-and-see attitude towards Mo Yi'er. \"Okay, I believe you and Xiao Lala. However, I heard from the leader of the Heim tribe that some large tribes have been very restless recently and they are very conspiratorial. I'm afraid that this person was sent by the large tribe.\" \"Brother, I promise not. This girl doesn't look like one of us. She has a strange animal skin on her body. , which has never happened in other large tribes, and she can't do anything, she is not like us at all!\" \"Are you sure he is a girl?\" Chu Yi put on a reserved attitude. Compared with the simple tribe members, he thinks a lot more and is not easy to trust people. Indeed, the tribe needs such a thoughtful leader, otherwise he will be eaten without even knowing it! When Ban Ge heard Chu Yi's question, he laughed: \"I just confirmed it today. She is too small, her hair is so short, and her breasts are still small! So she has been here for several days, well, these days, and I am sure today!\" Ban Ge picked five stones on the ground, representing five days, but they couldn't count yet, so they could only express it this way. \"It's not bad to be a girl. It doesn't matter if you don't know how to do anything. You can give birth to children for the men in the future!\" There are very few women in the tribe. Among the more than 20 people, only 7 are women. Chu Yi still doesn't believe that Mo Yi'er is a person from the gods. He just makes sure that she will not bring disaster to the tribe. \"Brother, who is that woman you brought?\" Bange asked about the woman who was next to Chu Yi just now. He had never seen her before, and she was not a member of the tribe. \"She is the daughter of the old leader of the Heim tribe!\" When Chu Yi answered, his eyes were filled with helplessness. \"Oh? But why did she come to our tribe?\" \"She fell in love with me and wanted to have my child before returning to the Heim tribe.\" After listening to Chu Yi's words, Fan Ge was full of anger: \"It's too much. If you fall in love with brother, you can join our Kannei tribe, and you want to take my brother's child away. It's just a dream!\" Chu Yi didn't say anything more, but the attitude in his eyes was exactly the same as that of Fan Ge. The woman was not allowed to bring his child back to the Heim tribe. At this moment, Mo Yi'er had been taken to a storage cave by Sang Zhen. The cave was full of animal skins. Because all kinds of fur are piled together, it creates a very complex smell, which is very unpleasant. But Mo Yi'er was still very excited. The furs were all real, not man-made. How much would they be worth in the 21st century? She can't figure it out! \"Mo Yi'er, you can choose any fur you like!\" Sang Zhen said to Mo Yi'er with a smile. Ever since she knew that Mo Yi'er fell from the sky, she has always respected Mo Yi'er. Apart from watching over Mo Yi'er, she was completely nice to her. \"Thank you!\" Mo Yi'er thanked her and selected among the many furs. These furs have only been briefly processed, so the skins are a little dry and hard and uncomfortable to touch. The weather was still very hot now, so Mo Yi'er chose two pieces of thin lambskin. Judging from the size, they should have been slaughtered when they were still lambs. Sang Zhen was a little surprised by Mo Yi'er's choice of fur, but she didn't say anything. After that, she and Mo Yi'er returned to the cave and took out bone needles and animal tendons to help Mo Yi'er sew the animal skin skirt. Bone needles are already very delicate daily necessities for primitive people, but compared with modern iron and steel needles, they are much clumsy. Mo Yi'er also took one. She planned to sew a small vest for herself so that she could show two little peaches like these primitive people. That was absolutely not allowed. Sewing a simple vest is a piece of cake for Mo Yi'er. Who knows that she grew up in an orphanage? Her elder sister, Mo Jinran, has a boyish personality, so she sometimes has to take care of her elder sister, sewing buttons for her, altering her clothes and so on. The orphanage is very poor. When they were young, they wore clothes donated by kindhearted people. There were almost no clothes in suitable sizes. There were very few staff in the orphanage, so they often had to change their own clothes. Use a piece of charcoal to draw the pattern of two vests on the white lambskin, then pick up Sang Zhen's stone knife and cut hard. This was a laborious job. The stone knife was too blunt and the skill required to cut off the sheepskin in an arc was too high. In order not to ruin the sheepskin, Mo Yi'er could only do it bit by bit. \"What are you doing?\" Chu Yi had already returned. Seeing Mo Yi'er struggling with the stone knife and sheepskin, he couldn't help but ask. However, the clean, impossibly handsome facial features were still expressionless, if anything, there was a little bit of arrogance, which made people look very uncomfortable. Mo Yi'er rolled her eyes at Chu Yi and did not answer. But Sang Zhen interrupted with a smile: \"Chief, Mo Yi'er said that I wanted to make a vest to wear on the chest!\" As he spoke, he pointed at his trembling breasts, which were as big as two melons! Chu Yi didn't have the consciousness that he couldn't look at other people's breasts. He nodded and looked at Mo Yi'er again.", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}